{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "55b0e148f63517f7706fbeba101e22a37617500b1db0ea251e43b1474d5ffb8b", "ja": "『灼熱少女』、始動！", "zh": "『灼热少女』启动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c62438bc425211e3f49f2d59ab012d414354efc741232fdcdfb6c6d003168054", "ja": "『灼熱少女』の初ミーティング。\nプロデューサーの前に集まったのは、自由で\n個性的なメンバーたち。そんな中、琴葉は\nリーダー兼センターに任命されて驚くが、\nメンバーの言葉に引き受けることを決める。", "zh": "『灼热少女』首次召开会议。\n随心所欲又充满个性的成员们，\n个个聚集在制作人面前。\n琴叶在会议中被任命为队长兼Center，\n这使她震惊不已，但最终被成员说服决定接任。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "20c7239cd3d435b00eef376db0da15c07d168c3a9fa15872bc8fb28dff885b0a", "ja": "（今日は灼熱少女の初ミーティングだ！）", "zh": "（今天是『灼热少女』第一次开会！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "baaff08c00e29d26f6ec6ab81c2eae8e0d3777d031ba6cd2b11dad4b79dfba84", "ja": "（仕事が長引いている琴葉以外の4人は、\nもう集まっているんだが……）", "zh": "（除了琴叶因工作而耽搁，\n其他四人已经到齐了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "1f023487d866058e5c2fde8d890268840dc5774083d431579ece28084258bab7", "ja": "ねえねえ、おやぶんっ！\nだいじな話って、なに！？", "zh": "欸欸，老大！\n你说有很重要的事是什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "c87e12aa1485f60e9117e71b18c4fbd3dc6b31a40e6fec8495870cd1190209f1", "ja": "私も、気になってたまらないよーっ！\n早く教えて、早く早くっ！", "zh": "我也好奇得不得了～！\n快点说嘛，快嘛快嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2b07ecb28e99c27368b8ec01de448dcc88ad4082053bf52ddb31d110ea8bc060", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと待ってくれ。\n話は全員そろってからだ。な？", "zh": "先、先等一下，\n等所有人到齐了再说，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "b61d9e3cc4720d8482f27afabe0e533be02dcceaf248e4ec0a48cf903ed29f6e", "ja": "何だろうな～、やっぱり新しいお仕事のコトかな？\n私、たくさん走るお仕事がいいなっ！", "zh": "会是什么事呢～八成是新工作的事吧？\n我想要可以一直跑步的工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "70a037a2619b7344c045aef80db6a8720e5848c503b462960fba48b940c3e96a", "ja": "走るの？　たまき、走るのはやいぞ～！\nうみみ、どっちがはやいか競争する？", "zh": "跑步？环跑得很快喔～！\n海美美，要不要比赛谁跑得比较快？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "efc244cd2192d63f0060493101a7e50b24075a345c559ecef00ba91b22738d72", "ja": "おっ、いいね！　環が相手なら手加減なしでいいし！\nそれじゃ、位置について！　よーい……。", "zh": "哦，不错耶！跟环比赛就不用放水了，真棒！\n那各就各位！预备……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "7f9e370c214da91c29d7f47d55e9a73dd6587cd9e9a10dc0936054f7f60a3065", "ja": "こらこらふたりとも、控え室で走るんじゃない！\n危ないし、ホコリが……ゲホッ、ゲホッ。", "zh": "慢着慢着，你们两个不准在准备室跑步！\n不但危险，还会有灰尘……咳咳、咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "e767042c2ce28edc378ba49ebe9ad447acd727705bdec1ed6f31435fb8615faf", "ja": "あっ……おやぶん、だいじょうぶ！？", "zh": "啊……老大，你没事吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "77956b913170e0ce9027bd32fdf4c45b5c6ddcbb25f13545ce90ad84faf19de1", "ja": "とと……ゴメンゴメン、{$P$}！\nつい、じっとしてらんなくて～。", "zh": "停停……抱歉抱歉，{$P$}！\n我实在是静不下来～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "2683d1d929541c19ee78b40e6438f17c7f9888f42a7681c310604d89bc5e8088", "ja": "にゃはは♪\nホント、じっとしてるのが苦手だよね～ふたりとも！", "zh": "呀哈哈♪\n要你们两个乖乖待着真的很难呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "526e6fd5cebfaa5275e0b4ddf7eb0414d5a3fffb3fa9345d04d1f50c022380ed", "ja": "私は、じっとしているのは、得意ですよ～。\nじ～～～～～～っ……。", "zh": "我就很擅长乖乖待着喔～\n静～～～～～～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "33bb67862c0cc248b43bf0f174562b9c25b0e7c39fa38e81fc08b9a445dc3325", "ja": "ちょっとちょっと、声出てるよ美也！\nていうか、なんかセミっぽくない……？", "zh": "喂喂，你发出声音了喔，美也！\n是说，不觉得很像蝉叫声吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "ba668a3c104caccd830074c2d9dcbffa52c6419b23073d6966e54c3aed908227", "ja": "セミですか～？\nセミよりは、ちょうちょのほうが好きですね～。", "zh": "蝉吗～？\n比起蝉，我更喜欢蝴蝶呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "69ccdc8214b5e46fdef404febbe3b79e7737c7b07a4e69a2495911d297876c72", "ja": "じゃあ次は、ちょうちょのマネをします～。\nいきますよ～。じ～～～～～～っ……。", "zh": "那我接下来要模仿蝴蝶～\n要开始啰～静～～～～～～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "162080ea59f4a328f07171d29c1db4ecc70567aa63c242d26d1e955b8b2c8ff8", "ja": "変わってない変わってない！\nっていうか、セミと同じじゃん！？", "zh": "根本没变、根本没变！\n是说，完全跟蝉一样嘛！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "2f1f79c6bc426cbf754019ff9d460b36411b9e335e8326fbc2a108e92602a70a", "ja": "春になったばかりで、まだ寒いですから～。\n今はサナギのちょうちょなので、動かないんですよ～。", "zh": "现在才刚入春，天气还很冷～\n所以刚才我模仿的是蛹里的蝴蝶，不会动喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "cc27ac4ad569245664138d5511241a1946a6e9b3dc1382fe74bc2e13f82f8d9c", "ja": "（うん……わかってはいたが、\nものすごく個性的な面々だな……！）", "zh": "（嗯……虽然早就知道了，\n但这群人真的是非常有个性啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "9ed60d8d7221e3d00a8e9d0750fad48007f7a6ee51e6920a41c7d6f8f12fbf81", "ja": "（このメンバーをまとめるのは、真面目な琴葉でも\n少し大変かもしれない。だが……）", "zh": "（要带领这些成员，哪怕是认真的琴叶，\n可能也会有点辛苦，但是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "5b8ba1bbce38d61fde55b8cdcba13f5b935c2e36c117d6c717eedada7721fee9", "ja": "お待たせしてすみません。今、戻りました！", "zh": "对不起让各位久等了，我回来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "cab8a53de8b00640fadb3f88ee0d6a8c78c052ffdffe6f8aaeb1421d28fb03b9", "ja": "あっ、琴葉！　おかえり～！", "zh": "啊，琴叶！欢迎回来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1022_042miy", "source_sha256": "37a0c8b814b7aefc9eea22de015e69b58b29e75e2b4417e3ca385dfd9f858181", "ja": "おかえりなさい、琴葉ちゃん。\nお仕事、お疲れさまでした～。", "zh": "欢迎回来，琴叶。\n工作辛苦了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "ce5e87d35733a96972b20e46411d3e427b70ed01ca955c803b533e70beb868bf", "ja": "琴葉、お疲れさま。\n悪いな、急がせちゃって。", "zh": "琴叶，辛苦了。\n不好意思，还让你赶过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "0f4b5b4faca92bf6994a0dc052fe5f04a9304b12a40bafdbf3a866c37955c8af", "ja": "いえ。さっそく、こうして\nお仕事をまかせてもらえて、光栄に思っています。", "zh": "哪里，工作能交代给我，\n我觉得非常荣幸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "610210f42da79b4cf7023a69014ca69cc5c7c37c87be4d566eff06f7fe43ec50", "ja": "おおー。さすが委員長、言うコトが違うね～。\nこりゃアタシも見習わなきゃだめかな？", "zh": "哦哦～不愧是班长，说出来的话就是不一样～\n看来我也要向你学习才行啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1026_017kth", "source_sha256": "0d589a43914b2f764da4fc8791e8c0f96528eb3f1c8e49cc5934013e7293f7b9", "ja": "もう、からかわないでよ、恵美……。", "zh": "真是的，不要逗我啦，惠美……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1027_040tam", "source_sha256": "190f0c02045d7fb4c5e5ec7f078e1fc12451a6ee1b41eaca08242441e3fb8874", "ja": "ことはって、ちょっとオトナの人みたい。\nなんかカッコイイぞ～。", "zh": "琴叶有点像是大人，\n感觉好帅～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "7fdbf2a73280e21cbcbb7b61c3ca2fd4ae126e75610b4373682ba74465d0afa3", "ja": "ね、すごいよね！　私なんて、\nしょっちゅう子どもっぽいって言われてるのに。", "zh": "对吧，她很厉害对吧！\n哪像我，老是被人家说很孩子气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "e789b322dad84400beee2fbc18bfb8a896d42c08771419d4c62b19c926fe38d6", "ja": "（謙虚な姿勢と努力家な面は、みんなも認めている。\nやっぱり、灼熱少女のリーダーは琴葉が適任だ！）", "zh": "（大家都认同她谦虚的态度与努力的一面。\n『灼热少女』的队长果然适合由琴叶担任！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "a91deb1cbbb465dff66407ea1f668a984cb77040d8b0c520c857d1d35ba0869e", "ja": "さてと……みんな、お待たせ！\n今日は、みんなに大事な発表がある。", "zh": "那么……各位，让你们久等了！\n今天有个重大消息要向各位宣布。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "fad4aed474aa3d26194c8f894658a53ca7fc703607d0e52d185792db9f047591", "ja": "実は、この5人で新しいユニットを\n結成してもらうことが決まったんだ。", "zh": "其实，\n已经确定要由你们五个人组成新团体了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1032_020meg", "source_sha256": "efde06413c7764253b605217b564e2de36a8998b08f6b711cdf3c8ae7b367788", "ja": "アタシたちで新ユニット？　ホントに！？", "zh": "由我们组成新团体？真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1033_p", "source_sha256": "3b0aaa9930821ad3293e7890114ef66c0ebed366a21ab20624bd6e9d48c28646", "ja": "ああ。ユニット名は、『灼熱少女』だ！", "zh": "没错，团体名称是『灼热少女』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1034_017kth", "source_sha256": "dc7c015c2ae42c32bcf85b3b5a96770ff3815a3fbb969c71f1660ce64d09b7e9", "ja": "『灼熱少女』……。", "zh": "『灼热少女』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1035_042miy", "source_sha256": "d68082cff6604882fc09797217ce59f8fd281d31f36e06976d8ba87f880d6471", "ja": "なるほど～。なかなか強そうですね～。\nどんな歌を歌うんでしょうか～。", "zh": "原来如此～听起来挺强的呢～\n我们会唱怎样的歌曲呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1036_040tam", "source_sha256": "0b66c4873d992b0093e7dd42f962e82033ff12d75bced4e7f691cee3997d4b60", "ja": "たまき、カッコイイのがいい！\nそれでね、ダンスも超カッコイイやつ……くふふ♪", "zh": "环喜欢帅气的！\n然后啊，舞蹈也要超帅气的那种……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1037_p", "source_sha256": "69a506aabf143c18128257846899a691b2049973909c0bd19a8f82a435780937", "ja": "はは、そうだな。……で、センターとリーダーは\n琴葉に頼みたいと思っているんだが、みんなはどうだ？", "zh": "哈哈，我明白……那么，至于Center跟队长，\n我想拜托琴叶担任，大家觉得如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1038_017kth", "source_sha256": "0045b690da0ee390f7601602a209a9ed5ee6de9ac45e4255958e1441fef8906e", "ja": "えっ！？　わ、私がセンターで……リーダー！？", "zh": "什么！？我、我来担任Center……兼队长！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1039_020meg", "source_sha256": "549b8c0b688e499f7afac9c69fd48115346d976fea0d6131d6a16a9e2ed4a22d", "ja": "おっ、いいじゃんいいじゃん！\n琴葉に任せればバッチリでしょ！　ね、琴葉？", "zh": "哦，不错啊、不错啊！\n交给琴叶准没错！对吧，琴叶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1040_017kth", "source_sha256": "e24a31868fa524cd877dc216ffead7f95e9a762c7f0912b671fe229fba5ce49b", "ja": "でも、私に務まるかな……？", "zh": "但是，我能胜任吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1041_029umi", "source_sha256": "6377651fb18a619977ac9fe499911997a311fd0318f416fe0a55981d879491dc", "ja": "琴葉なら大丈夫だよっ！\n真面目だし、すっごくしっかりしてるし……。", "zh": "琴叶一定没问题啦！\n毕竟你个性认真，又非常能干……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1042_042miy", "source_sha256": "f930425769bda7174d2bfd59c7834e05e4fe4b3cc339ef1b38ca9b13f63d165a", "ja": "そうですね～、琴葉ちゃんは頼りになりますし……。\nそれにいざという時には、私たちもいますからね～。", "zh": "就是说啊～琴叶相当可靠……\n而且要是真的有个万一，也还有我们啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1043_040tam", "source_sha256": "8b4a9a8bad710d92aefc3f450eb9d0c0942498d9c44a9e968d66249160f8edb8", "ja": "ことはがリーダーなの？\nじゃあ、たまきがレッドやるから、命令してね！", "zh": "琴叶是队长吗？\n那环要当红色战士，请下达命令吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1044_020meg", "source_sha256": "bd295e257f4175027b76ba1afa963451952b4891348344a35e1ff443442bdfbd", "ja": "よしよしよしよし、環はイイコだな～。\nそういうワケで、みんな琴葉がリーダーに賛成だって！", "zh": "好乖好乖，环真是好孩子～\n就是这样，大家都很赞成琴叶当队长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1045_017kth", "source_sha256": "430bceaa83e826bfa7e382b201cc1007533ce68b57a73d0503025ab77deeb0e2", "ja": "恵美……みんな……。", "zh": "惠美……大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1046_017kth", "source_sha256": "1ad4e92b51bf1d9e1c1be898be38f05bdd85719d91a90a9aff563d041f0aa8b0", "ja": "わかりました。みんながそう言ってくれるなら……\n灼熱少女のセンターとリーダー、引き受けます！", "zh": "我明白了。既然大家都这么说……\n我愿意担任『灼热少女』的Center跟队长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1047_p", "source_sha256": "7410838013ccc46e3f3debeade85bb10cad316e5912397df273b5ffe84c7c7c9", "ja": "よかった。\nそれじゃ、みんなのまとめ役は、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "太好了。\n那就拜托你负责带领大家啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1048_017kth", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1049_p", "source_sha256": "efb1a4eebd26fe0f3bfaa6e90fbde398f4249ac2663e91b361023d7fbd54e8ed", "ja": "（自由すぎるくらい個性の強いメンバーだが、\n琴葉を中心に、きっとうまくやってくれるだろう）", "zh": "（虽然成员们都很有个性，甚至有点太自由奔放，\n但我想她们一定会以琴叶为中心顺利团结在一起。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_01_1050_p", "source_sha256": "40bfb9ce4371aaad41bb72f2a981a671be4ce0f089a98ca6e53ecf8fb2802255", "ja": "（灼熱少女……どんなユニットに仕上がるか、\n今から楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（『灼热少女』……会成为怎么样的团体呢？\n真叫人期待！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
